@startuml
!include estilo.iuml
title ATLAS v.1.0 · Classes do Desktop e dos terminais JavaFX

allowmixing
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction

class Application <<JavaFX>>
package "Desktop · atlas.desktop" {
  class Desktop {
    +start(stage)
  }
  class Central
  class Workspace {
    ~refresh()
    -detail(row)
    -mutate(route, fields, update)
  }
  class Panorama {
    ~refresh()
  }
  class "Panorama.Card" as Card <<record>> {
    node: Parent
    metrics: String[]
    labels: String[]
    note: String
  }
  class Forms {
    {static} ~edit(page, row)
    {static} ~detail(title, description, primary, secondary)
  }
}
package "Terminais" {
  class Bar {
    +start(stage)
  }
  class Cozinha {
    +start(stage)
  }
  class KitchenPrinting {
    -refresh()
    -record(client, id)
  }
}
package "Clientes JavaFX · atlas.cliente" {
  class SessionView {
    +start()
    +listen(callback)
    +publish(event, fields)
    +logout()
    {static} +load(owner, path)
  }
  class Client {
    {static} +login(server, username, password): Client
    +get(route)
    +post(route, body)
    +put(route, body)
  }
  class "Client.ApiError" as ApiError {
    status: int
  }
  class Events {
    +connect()
    +publish(event, body)
    +close()
  }
  class TerminalView {
    +refresh()
    +selected(): JsonObject
    -command(state, error)
  }
}
artifact "FXML e CSS\nDesktop, Bar, Cozinha e sessão" as Layouts

Application <|-- Desktop
Application <|-- Bar
Application <|-- Cozinha
Desktop ..> SessionView : inicia sessão
Desktop ..> Central : abre após login
Central --> Client
Central *-- "0..*" Workspace
Central *-- "0..1" Panorama
Workspace --> Client
Workspace ..> Forms
Panorama --> Client
Panorama *-- "0..*" Card
Bar ..> TerminalView : cria
Bar ..> SessionView : inicia sessão
Cozinha ..> SessionView : inicia sessão
Cozinha ..> KitchenPrinting : cria
KitchenPrinting --> SessionView
KitchenPrinting *-- TerminalView
TerminalView --> SessionView
SessionView --> "0..1" Client : sessão REST
SessionView --> "0..1" Events : conexão MQTT
Events --> Client : identidade da sessão
Client ..> ApiError : resposta HTTP não OK
SessionView ..> Layouts : carrega recursos
@enduml
